"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4499800","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3012410-1846651706691060","game_id":"steam-3012410","kind":"update","title":"Nextfest Update","summary":"Everise is participating in October Nextfest. We've updated the demo for the occasion, if you've already played before here's a list of everything that is new: Boss Rooms: Locked doors may now appear during your exploration. Behind those doors are special themed rooms, each with a special enemy waiting for you. Those rooms can be more challenging than regular rooms, but they may contain unique rewards. Make sure you always have a key with you if you plan to access them tho! Daily Modifiers: Each","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:22:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691060","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3012410-1837955055361532","game_id":"steam-3012410","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"Hi! Everise Demo just got updated. The most improtant change is the implementation of controller support, it is considered experimental for now, so I'd love to get your feedback on the buttons layout. Button binds are explained in the tutorial. Please post a message if you have specific button layout you'd prefer. French localization was also added. Just in time for your national holiday and world cup victory, yay.I tried to make sure this update would not corrupt your existing save files, so ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T16:49:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055361532","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3012410-1830163047260165","game_id":"steam-3012410","kind":"announcement","title":"Everise Demo is out now!","summary":"Hey everyone! We're excited to announce that the Everise demo is now out and playable, just in time for the Medieval Fest! Thanks for all your support during the playtest, we were able to squash several bugs and improve the early game experience. During playtest we also noticing an influx of players from China, after a quick investigation we found out that some Chinese content creartors had uploaded videos of therri playthrough. We are very grateful and excited to see all this interest for our g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T13:39:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047260165","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3012410-1826992588599567","game_id":"steam-3012410","kind":"announcement","title":"Thanks to all the playtesters","summary":"Huge thanks to all the players who expressed interest and playtested the game.We received some very good feedback, and noticed a big increase in wishlists. This is super encouraging and the exact support we needed to help us push forward :)I will close the playtest at the end of next week, on March 22 new playtesters won't be able to request acess, and the playtest itself will be disabled a bit later.The game won't be unplayable for long, a demo version should come out in the following month, we","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-15T13:21:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588599567","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3012410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10